e-the-way-to-your-dream-canine-companion-that-wont-trigger-sniffles-180989303/</link><description>遗传学家改变了阿尔菲和贝利的 DNA，使他们不会产生主要的过敏原。然而，像它们这样的犬科动物目前还没有商业化，一些专家对改变动物基因表示道德担忧</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 19:12:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/allergic-to-dogs-these-gene-edited-beagles-could-pave-the-way-to-your-dream-canine-companion-that-wont-trigger-sniffles-180989303/</guid></item><item><title>这位 91 岁的老人在阿巴拉契亚小道徒步旅行时摔倒了 71 次。他刚刚成为完成 2,190 英里长途跋涉的最年长的人</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-91-year-old-man-fell-71-times-while-hiking-appalachian-trail-he-just-became-oldest-person-complete-2190-mile-trek-180989428/</link><description>戴尔·桑德斯 (Dale Sanders) 在不到一年的时间里完成了这次加息。绰号“灰胡子”的他对抗衰老的耐力并不陌生</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 18:24:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-91-year-old-man-fell-71-times-while-hiking-appalachian-trail-he-just-became-oldest-person-complete-2190-mile-trek-180989428/</guid></item><item><title>倡导者称，洛杉矶的弗兰克·劳埃德·赖特住宅面临“因疏忽而被拆除”的危险</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-frank-lloyd-wright-house-in-la-is-in-danger-of-demolition-by-neglect-say-advocates-180989429/</link><description>这位有远见的人以他负担得起的乌索尼亚风格设计了这套两居室、一间浴室。这是洛杉矶唯一的此类房屋</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 17:18:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-frank-lloyd-wright-house-in-la-is-in-danger-of-demolition-by-neglect-say-advocates-180989429/</guid></item><item><title>火星南半部的地下异常温暖。 “热异常”可能解释了为什么地球的半球看起来如此不同</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/mars-southern-half-is-weirdly-warm-underground-the-thermal-anomaly-might-explain-why-the-planets-hemispheres-look-so-different-180989424/</link><description>研究人员使用了一种新颖的技术来弄清楚这颗红色星球内部正在发生什么。这项工作表明，南半球内部比北半球内部温度高数百度，并且部分熔化</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 15:47:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/